- line 335 explicit assumption Site B corridor = 1200 -> superseded.
- line 353 G1.
- line 370-373.
- line 385 trigger "Site B width measured at or above..." -> now measured 700, so trigger becomes corridor widening or narrower unit.
- line 446 assumption ledger.
- line 457 no measured Site B width -> update.
- 10.3 assumptions A-01 etc. Keep A-02/A-03. Remove? no A-04. Could add A-05? Maybe measured width is a measurement, not assumption.
- 10.4 revision record.

Also the status "HOLD — verification only. No award..." Fine, but Site B now infeasible with current units. Perhaps status "HOLD — no procurement; Site A conditional shortlist; Site B blocked (700 mm corridor excludes all units; no current 2026 coastal certificate)". Integrated decision: HOLD overall.

